WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.570
In this video, you will find the neighborhood contests, where you can vote for your favorite homes, enter your own, or see who won.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.656
We start on the map.

00:00:09.558 --> 00:00:13.620
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.745
That is the only address you need.

00:00:18.645 --> 00:00:21.052
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:21.052 --> 00:00:24.796
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:26.133
Tap Use my location.

00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:32.868
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:36.073
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:36.073 --> 00:00:40.633
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:43.697 --> 00:00:46.386
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:47.581
See the three dots?

00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:51.884
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:52.422
Tap them.

00:00:54.109 --> 00:00:55.747
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:55.747 --> 00:01:01.085
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:01:02.886 --> 00:01:05.828
Live now lists the contests that are open today.

00:01:05.828 --> 00:01:10.332
On each one, you can vote for your favorite homes, or enter your own home.

00:01:10.332 --> 00:01:15.856
Voting and entering each have their own dates, so a contest shows what you can do right now.

00:01:16.761 --> 00:01:17.343
Tap Mine.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.974
This is your personal page.

00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:24.334
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:01:26.168 --> 00:01:29.067
Tap Past results, for contests that are finished.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:33.357
You can see the winners in every category, and look back at earlier years.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:39.356
That is the Contests page: Live now, Mine, and Past results.

00:01:39.356 --> 00:01:47.693
Contests also show up on the map as cards, with a button to enter or vote, so you may find one without ever opening this page.

00:01:49.102 --> 00:01:52.003
Next up: Find professionally installed displays.
